<view class="page"><view class="top"><view class="eyebrow">测试与日常使用</view><view class="title">遇到问题，一键上报</view><view class="subtitle">系统会自动附带小程序版本、当前页面、手机环境和最近操作，不需要您手工整理。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="label">影响程度</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{severityOptions}}" value="{{severityIndex}}" bindchange="changeSeverity"><view class="picker">{{severity}}</view></picker><view class="label">当前页面</view><view class="context">{{page}}</view><view class="label">发生了什么</view><textarea value="{{description}}" bindinput="inputDescription" placeholder="例如：点击提交后一直转圈，返回后工单没有出现"/><view class="label">你希望系统做到什么</view><textarea value="{{expected}}" bindinput="inputExpected" placeholder="例如：提交一次并显示工单编号"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="chooseScreenshot">{{screenshotName || '添加问题截图（推荐）'}}</button><button class="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">提交问题</button></view></view>
